t player to 10 points wins!\n- **Play with friends** in private lobbies or join public games to show off your skills.\n\n{1681145515836822}\n\n- **Grab power-ups** to spray your foes as the Xterminator, wield lethal bee stingers and even fly like a butterfly. \n- **Customize your spider** & buy new accessories or skins in the store.", "short_description": "Swing, crawl & dunk your way to the top in Spiders, a free-to-play Tag-like."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://soaringrocstudio.net/policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Soaring Roc Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://soaringrocstudio.net/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "10069048323119346"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392157_1306908547263714_5376233536884851654_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FXQsOnAzbpQQ7kNvwHjgJtS&_nc_oc=Adoy_QHRFDgKa28dUdADwW30Uaa6C0t05KJB65uJiTSHCIq7xvY-AI90CSZQ4e_pMOs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-hRqCSiXK_Ie6POAjrgHDqzad4aIxi0V84UUu0b41xbQ&oe=6A2D52CB"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Spiders", "platform": 